{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>8月7日消息，微信正在內測朋友圈AI相關功能。有用户反饋，朋友圈新增 「AI幫寫」 與 「AI點評」 兩項能力。從截圖來看，發佈朋友圈界面右下角出現 「AI 幫寫」 按鈕，可以藉助AI輔助生成朋友圈文案。</p>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0807/08b963ed1a5b07f.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/6036A4C7798085EC36E2D9ADB0F437A1B1C45285_size57_w1280_h1830.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/2550786A665C93E2B3AB52EAC9744961C7D5D1EB_size148_w1280_h2781.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0807/042348d08521035.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/4F0D7791C4A29FE5EA5108E868677FA9B979E53C_size254_w1206_h2622.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w852_h1362_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/D2B37120C07959084A5B9210163CF23293934FD0_size76_w852_h1362.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/45B2085F4AF84ABA9859EC2273CF8E0EB09AD0A9_size118_w1170_h2532.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>針對已發佈的朋友圈評論，長按評論會彈出 「AI點評」 選項，調用微信原生AI 「小微」 對這條評論進行趣味解讀、生成回復內容。</p>\n<p>據悉，該功能隸屬於微信AI助手小微，目前處於小範圍灰度測試階段。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/DF1A1FA668108A4B42D44555F8DF7CB7A1155051_size302_w1320_h966.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0807/08b963ed1a5b07f.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/6036A4C7798085EC36E2D9ADB0F437A1B1C45285_size57_w1280_h1830.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/2550786A665C93E2B3AB52EAC9744961C7D5D1EB_size148_w1280_h2781.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0807/042348d08521035.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/4F0D7791C4A29FE5EA5108E868677FA9B979E53C_size254_w1206_h2622.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w852_h1362_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/D2B37120C07959084A5B9210163CF23293934FD0_size76_w852_h1362.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/45B2085F4AF84ABA9859EC2273CF8E0EB09AD0A9_size118_w1170_h2532.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T01:29:22.586395+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":15,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}